        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>八款最好喝的梅酒 - 女生微醺必备酒款</title>\n<style>\n  * {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    background-color: #2c3e6b;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .container {\n    background-color: #f5f0e8;\n    max-width: 780px;\n    width: 100%;\n    border: 6px solid #2c3e6b;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 20px 25px 30px;\n  }\n\n  .main-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #8b1a1a;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n  }\n\n  .subtitle-bar {\n    background-color: #8b1a1a;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    padding: 12px 20px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .product-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 0;\n  }\n\n  .product-row {\n    display: contents;\n  }\n\n  .product-cell {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 12px 8px;\n    border-bottom: 3px dotted #c0392b;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .product-cell:nth-child(odd) {\n    border-right: 3px dotted #c0392b;\n    padding-right: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .product-cell:nth-child(even) {\n    padding-left: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .product-cell:last-child,\n  .product-cell:nth-last-child(2) {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n\n  .product-img {\n    width: 80px;\n    min-width: 80px;\n    height: 140px;\n    background-color: #e8e0d0;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-right: 12px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .product-content {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .product-name {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background-color: #8b1a1a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 4px 14px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .product-desc {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  .divider-row {\n    display: contents;\n  }\n\n  .dot-divider {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px 0;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    border-bottom: 3px dotted #c0392b;\n  }\n\n  .dot-divider:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n\n  .row-wrapper {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    border-bottom: 3px dotted #c0392b;\n  }\n\n  .row-wrapper:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n\n  .row-wrapper .product-cell {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n\n  .row-wrapper .product-cell:first-child {\n    border-right: 3px dotted #c0392b;\n    padding-right: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .row-wrapper .product-cell:last-child {\n    padding-left: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .dot-separator {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 6px 0;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 10px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <h1 class=\"main-title\">八款最好喝的梅酒</h1>\n  <div class=\"subtitle-bar\">女生微醺必备酒款</div>\n\n  <!-- Row 1 -->\n  <div class=\"row-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"product-cell\">\n      <div class=\"product-img\">[山崎梅酒<br>樽仕入<br>瓶身图]</div>\n      <div class=\"product-content\">\n        <div class=\"product-name\">山崎梅酒樽仕入</div>\n        <div class=\"product-desc\">山崎入门级梅酒，也是最经典的一款，口感也是接受度最高的一款。目前已经停产，市场上存量越来越少，想喝或者想收藏小伙伴可以尽快尝试一下。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"product-cell\">\n      <div class=\"product-img\">[山崎梅酒<br>樽酿<br>瓶身图]</div>\n      <div class=\"product-content\">\n        <div class=\"product-name\">山崎梅酒樽酿</div>\n        <div class=\"product-desc\">代替樽仕入经典款的新产品，与经典款相同的是，都是使用白兰地作为基酒，但是新款的酒精度提到了20度，相比经典款香味与烟熏味道更重一些。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dot-separator\">● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ●</div>\n\n  <!-- Row 2 -->\n  <div class=\"row-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"product-cell\">\n      <div class=\"product-img\">[俏雅黑金<br>本格<br>瓶身图]</div>\n      <div class=\"product-content\">\n        <div class=\"product-name\">俏雅黑金本格</div>\n        <div class=\"product-desc\">这是一款白兰地本格梅酒，所以品尝起来会感觉这款酒的味道浓厚一些，可以搭配气泡水一起饮用，口感会更顺滑。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"product-cell\">\n      <div class=\"product-img\">[杂贺纪州<br>梅酒<br>瓶身图]</div>\n      <div class=\"product-content\">\n        <div class=\"product-name\">杂贺纪州梅酒</div>\n        <div class=\"product-desc\">闻名遐迩的杂贺清酒为酒底，放入梅子加以浸泡，最后再放入美味的梅子酱，口感浓稠甘甜，而青梅的酸度对健康多多有益处。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dot-separator\">● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ●</div>\n\n  <!-- Row 3 -->\n  <div class=\"row-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"product-cell\">\n      <div class=\"product-img\">[三得利<br>梅酒<br>瓶身图]</div>\n      <div class=\"product-content\">\n        <div class=\"product-name\">三得利梅酒</div>\n        <div class=\"product-desc\">这款是三得利旗下的经典梅酒，酸甜爽口，口感愉悦，冰镇后梅酒的口感进一步被激发，再加上一杯苏打水，不论是配餐还是睡前酌酌都是很好的选择。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"product-cell\">\n      <div class=\"product-img\">[明石信威<br>士忌梅酒<br>瓶身图]</div>\n      <div class=\"product-content\">\n        <div class=\"product-name\">明石信威士忌梅酒</div>\n        <div class=\"product-desc\">女生会喜欢的威士忌梅酒，黄金比例调配，醇厚香甜的酒体，细腻顺口的口感。第一次尝试时，让人很难感受到威士忌的存在，直到喝完后的回甘才发现它们完美的融合在了一起。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dot-separator\">● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ● ●</div>\n\n  <!-- Row 4 -->\n  <div class=\"row-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"product-cell\">\n      <div class=\"product-img\">[蝶矢黑糖<br>梅酒<br>瓶身图]</div>\n      <div class=\"product-content\">\n        <div class=\"product-name\">蝶矢黑糖梅酒</div>\n        <div class=\"product-desc\">来自冲绳的黑糖与梅酒的完美融合，黑糖里的甘蔗矿物质给梅酒带来了独特的芳香甜味，推荐与牛奶一起搭配，口感顺滑醇厚又饱满~</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"product-cell\">\n      <div class=\"product-img\">[长乐无忧<br>梅酒<br>瓶身图]</div>\n      <div class=\"product-content\">\n        <div class=\"product-name\">长乐无忧梅酒</div>\n        <div class=\"product-desc\">一款国产的优秀梅酒，被超高颜值吸引来尝试，被其圆润的口感俘获，清爽酸甜的口感，入口后，淡淡的青梅香一直保留，值得一提的是，这款酒十分健康，即使是在身材管理的女生也可以放心饮用~</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
